  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OECS-Catastrophe Insurance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to reduce the participating country&apos;s financial vulnerability to natural disasters (earthquakes and hurricanes).  This is being achieved through the provision of financing to allow these countries to join the Caribbean Catastrophe Risk Insurance Facility and the purchase of financial protection against catastrophic hurricane and/or earthquake losses.</narrative>
  </description>
